OL,3,APrince Harry and Meghan land in UK days
OL,4,Aafter announcing move
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duke and Duchess of Sussex have
OL,7,Farrived back in the UK, BBC News
OL,8,Funderstands.
OL,10,FPrince Harry, Meghan and their children
OL,11,FArchie and Lilibet are believed to have
OL,12,Fflown into the country privately from
OL,13,FCalifornia, and landed in Birmingham
OL,14,Fshortly before midday.
OL,16,FA spokesman for the Duke and Duchess of
OL,17,FSussex said "this is not something we
OL,18,Fwould comment on".
OL,20,FThere did not appear to be a police
OL,21,Fpresence as Harry and his family left
OL,22,Fthe airport, a source told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/38
